    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφθείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroy utterly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Scymn.
				344
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.44
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφθείρομαι</span>
			<i>to be undone, ruined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεφθαρμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					669
				</span></i>
			: Com., 'go to the devil', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφθαρεὶς οὐκ οἶδ᾽ ὅποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					72
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφθείρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					15.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
